{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Everything moves when you move.</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1969810/extras/c7a22c83cf6fa561f27fe1ee0da016ad.webp?t=1757323957\" width=598 height=43 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1969810/extras/32317c656d86b13d3288d24a08398886.poster.avif?t=1757323957\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1969810/extras/32317c656d86b13d3288d24a08398886.webm?t=1757323957\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1969810/extras/32317c656d86b13d3288d24a08398886.mp4?t=1757323957\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Alternate between bold action and careful planning.\u00a0Bullets hang frozen in mid-air. Enemies lurk in stasis. But the second you move, so does everything else</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1969810/extras/eb48d2434a49842665487891eecde363.webp?t=1757323957\" width=598 height=43 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1969810/extras/171121eba08e0140faeb047c7b06565f.poster.avif?t=1757323957\" width=600 height=323 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1969810/extras/171121eba08e0140faeb047c7b06565f.webm?t=1757323957\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each character has a unique set of abilities. From the old-fashioned dodge roll to bullet reflecting kinetic surges</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1969810/extras/1baf524d691788d116e598c065f168dc.webp?t=1757323957\" width=598 height=43 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1969810/extras/cc463d7a2e875f99b8173d6dddaec94b.poster.avif?t=1757323957\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1969810/extras/cc463d7a2e875f99b8173d6dddaec94b.webm?t=1757323957\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1969810/extras/cc463d7a2e875f99b8173d6dddaec94b.mp4?t=1757323957\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cowboys with knives, clockwork lifeforms, parasitic insect swarms, diesel-powered mole-men, and war-torn hellscapes are only some of the wild combinations a Chronosphere will create after consuming a world</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1969810/extras/93b1f1aedcb73107775204836c13c9e1.webp?t=1757323957\" width=598 height=43 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1969810/extras/4ea28edda6f6cc03fe6de416292e18a0.poster.avif?t=1757323957\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1969810/extras/4ea28edda6f6cc03fe6de416292e18a0.webm?t=1757323957\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1969810/extras/4ea28edda6f6cc03fe6de416292e18a0.mp4?t=1757323957\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find unique weapons and abilities, and create loadouts blending gear and skills from different worlds. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1969810/extras/aafc5be1c575b11f2bf345a83d1b79db.webp?t=1757323957\" width=598 height=43 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1969810/extras/4ccf06be8a39278cccebb8e0af5b5a3f.avif?t=1757323957\" width=800 height=564 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The rules of physics melt inside a Chronosphere: anticipate distortions, mutations, and plunderable paradoxes. Flow seamlessly between real-time action and turn-based tactics. Choose between stabilizing your wounds or saving reality. The deeper you go, the weirder it gets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1969810/extras/c9f510574a8d7cfe016bb074972ee1d8.avif?t=1757323957\" width=600 height=152 /></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1969810?t=1757323957","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1969810/cc52342a354f85f4c944718b8485fdc1cfbf5c93/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1757323957","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1969810/c91d3bd42be2c995140c874f0e0fc5b7a94940e8/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1757323957","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1969810/c91d3bd42be2c995140c874f0e0fc5b7a94940e8/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1757323957","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h1>Feature List</h1><p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique characters with distinctive combat styles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Procedurally generated levels ensure no two runs feel the same, with new challenges at every turn</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deep roguelike progression with meta-unlocks and wild build variety</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Smart enemies that react to your moves in real time</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stylized visuals and a pulsating soundtrack</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combines the adrenaline of real-time combat with the depth of turn-based decision-making</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Time, bullets, and enemies only move when the player moves.</p></li></ul></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Everything moves when you move.</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1969810/extras/c7a22c83cf6fa561f27fe1ee0da016ad.webp?t=1757323957\" width=598 height=43 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1969810/extras/32317c656d86b13d3288d24a08398886.poster.avif?t=1757323957\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1969810/extras/32317c656d86b13d3288d24a08398886.webm?t=1757323957\" type=\"vide